<title>INDIA: India Maharashtra sets one-for-one bonus.</title>
<headline>India Maharashtra sets one-for-one bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Maharashtra Scooters on Wednesday said it would offer investors one bonus equity share for every one share held.</p>
<p>The decision to issue bonus equity shares was taken at a board meeting.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
